line on stdout.  Implements three operations:

  * ``replay`` -- bounded star switch with cumulative acknowledgements.
  * ``audit``  -- observational safety / fair termination of a finite graph.
  * ``export`` -- lossless TLA+ ``ModelData`` module export.

